        "node_id": "n_2_44f6d1",
        "thought_text": "Use depth-first search (DFS) instead of breadth-first search (BFS) to explore the rooms and determine if they are returnable. DFS is more suitable for this problem because it can efficiently explore paths and detect cycles, which are crucial for determining if a room is returnable.",
