        "node_id": "n_3_3bc828",
        "thought_text": "Dynamic programming approach is not suitable here because it doesn't account for the circular nature of the rooms and conveyor belts. Instead, we should use a different approach that considers the connectivity of the rooms in a circular manner. We need to check if there exists a path from each room back to itself considering the given conveyor belt states.",
