        "node_id": "n_12_f9a8d2",
        "thought_text": "Implement a breadth-first search (BFS) instead of depth-first search (DFS). BFS might be more intuitive for this problem due to the circular nature of the rooms and could potentially offer better performance by exploring all possible paths level by level.",
